WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.750
So, the decisions, with their owners.

2
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:04.512
None of them is a procurement.

3
00:00:04.512 --> 00:00:09.256
The CIO names an agency-level owner of
the Zero Trust posture and a cross-pillar

4
00:00:09.256 --> 00:00:13.342
correlation owner, separate from
any cloud provider relationship,

5
00:00:13.342 --> 00:00:16.626
and puts the scope of the
whole-agency score in writing.

6
00:00:16.626 --> 00:00:19.905
The identity-plane owner
reconciles the network,

7
00:00:19.905 --> 00:00:25.025
every cloud and the virtualization estate
to one record before any is scored.

8
00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:27.730
The program lead finds
out, pillar by pillar,

9
00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:31.187
which evidence can be re-run
without the operator's help.

10
00:00:31.187 --> 00:00:36.369
The CISO moves every exception into the
configuration file with an expiration,

11
00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:40.777
covers the assessment hosts and
accounts in the Agency Logging Plan,

12
00:00:40.777 --> 00:00:44.798
due 90 days after August 20,
brings any Google Workspace tenant

13
00:00:44.798 --> 00:00:49.051
into the inventory by November 2,
and time-boxes privileged access.

14
00:00:49.051 --> 00:00:53.103
The program lead and security
operations stand up drift detection,

15
00:00:53.103 --> 00:00:56.287
and the authorizing official
receives its findings.

16
00:00:56.287 --> 00:00:59.404
And every government-cloud
feature gap is recorded

17
00:00:59.404 --> 00:01:02.376
as a governed finding, not
an unstated assumption.

18
00:01:02.376 --> 00:01:05.050
Each is a structural step that compounds.

19
00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:06.726
Unify first, assess second,

20
00:01:06.726 --> 00:01:10.688
and let named people make the
decisions the evidence supports.

21
00:01:10.688 --> 00:01:15.313
No tool, and no number of tools,
certifies Zero Trust maturity.

22
00:01:15.313 --> 00:01:19.287
Book 11 has the detail,
with every claim footnoted.

23
00:01:19.287 --> 00:01:20.110
Thank you.
